---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="GTA Weekly Bonuses | 2 Smokin' Barrels"
        description="Heist Event week starts now! Log in to get The Great Circle Back Mansion Painting Decoration, win an Adversary Mode for GTA$100,000, and earn 2X GTA$ on first-time Heist completions."
        image="https://2smokinbarrels.com/images/gta-bonuses-banner.jpg"
    >
    <main class="container">
       
        <header class="page-header">
            <h1 class="page-title">GTA Weekly Report</h1>
            <p class="date-range">November 5, 2026 — November 11, 2026</p>
            
            <div class="highlight-box highlight-box-left">
                <p>
                    A new GTA Online event starts on November 5 (available through November 11). It's <span class="highlight-orange">Heist Event week</span> in GTA Online! Log in to get The Great Circle Back Mansion Painting Decoration, win an Adversary Mode for the Weekly Challenge's <span class="highlight-pink">GTA$100,000</span>, and earn 2X GTA$ first-time completion bonuses on the Original Heists, The Doomsday Heist, The Diamond Casino Heist and KnoWay Out.
                </p>
            </div>
        </header>

        <!-- WEEKLY BONUSES GRID -->
        <div class="bonus-grid">
            <div class="bonus-card">
                <h3>Event Highlights & Challenges</h3>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Weekly Challenge:</strong> Win an Adversary Mode to get GTA$100,000</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Login Unlock:</strong> Log in to receive The Great Circle Back Mansion Painting Decoration</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Cayo Perico Heist:</strong> Guaranteed Panther Statue Primary Target in your first run of The Cayo Perico Heist</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Kortz Center Heist:</strong> Guaranteed The Outcome of Endeavour Primary Target Painting in your first run of The Kortz Center Heist</div>
            </div>

            <div class="bonus-card">
                <h3>Bonus GTA$ & RP</h3>
                <div class="bonus-item"><span class="multiplier">3X</span> <strong>GTA$ & RP:</strong> Mansion Raid</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><span class="multiplier">2X</span> <strong>GTA$ & RP:</strong> Community Race Series</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><span class="multiplier">2X</span> <strong>FIRST TIME COMPLETION BONUS:</strong> All Original Heists, The Doomsday Heist (all Acts), The Diamond Casino Heist, and KnoWay Out</div>
            </div>

            <div class="bonus-card">
                <h3>Discounts & Gun Van</h3>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>40% OFF:</strong> Casino Master Penthouse (including Upgrades & Modifications), Facility Properties (including Upgrades & Modifications), and High-End Apartments</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>30% OFF Vehicles:</strong> Benefactor Vorschlaghammer, Cheval Taipan, Dinka Blista Kanjo, Grotti Cheetah, HVY Insurgent, Invetero Coquette D5, Maibatsu Penumbra FF, Pegassi Reaper, Western Company Besra, and Western Rampant Rocket</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>25% OFF Vehicles:</strong> Grotti Veleno GT (First Time Vehicle Discount)</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Gun Van (FREE):</strong> Baseball Bat & Knife</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Gun Van (50% OFF):</strong> Precision Rifle</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Gun Van (40% OFF GTA+):</strong> Compact EMP Launcher</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Gun Van (80% OFF GTA+):</strong> Armor</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Gun Van (Standard):</strong> El Strickler, Sweeper Shotgun, Widowmaker, Knuckle Dusters, Proximity Mines, Pipe Bombs & Molotovs</div>
            </div>

            <div class="bonus-card">
                <h3>Free Vehicles & Showrooms</h3>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Lucky Wheel:</strong> Överflöd Entity XXR</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>LS Car Meet Prize Ride:</strong> Annis Hellion (Place Top 5 in the LS Car Meet Series for three days in a row)</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Premium Deluxe Motorsport:</strong> Dinka Blista Kanjo, Grotti Cheetah, Invetero Coquette D5, Maibatsu Penumbra FF & Benefactor Vorschlaghammer</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Luxury Autos:</strong> Grotti Veleno GT & Grotti GT750</div>
            </div>

            <div class="bonus-card">
                <h3>Test Rides & Trials</h3>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Test Track:</strong> Cheval Taipan, HVY Insurgent & Pegassi Reaper</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Premium Test Ride (HSW):</strong> Grotti Brioso R/A</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Premium Race:</strong> At the Races</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Time Trials:</strong> LSIA (Standard) & Del Perro Beach to Murietta Heights (HSW)</div>
            </div>
             
            <div class="bonus-card">
                <h3>Heists & Robberies</h3>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Kortz Center Primary Targets:</strong> "The Outcome of Endeavour", "To Beat About the Bush", "Hare Oneself Think" & "True Love"</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>FIB Priority File:</strong> The Black Box File</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Salvage Yard (Top Tier):</strong> The McTony Robbery - Lampadati Cinquemila</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Salvage Yard (Standard Tier):</strong> The Cargo Ship Robbery - Truffade Z-Type</div>
                <div class="bonus-item"><strong>Salvage Yard (Low Tier):</strong> The Podium Robbery - Annis Hellion</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="back-nav">
            <a href="/" class="back-link">&larr; Back to Home</a>
        </div>
    </main>
</Layout>